# Cocoon can enchant an already tapped Llanowar Elves; Quirion Ranger can untap it despite the untap-step restriction.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Quirion Ranger
Cocoon
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Quirion Ranger.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cocoon.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Cocoon.Counters.Pupa = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Quirion Ranger.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Choose(Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Tapped = false
Bot1.Battlefield.Cocoon.Counters.Pupa = 3
